            0.064
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Large Numbers Around Us"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.086,
            0.847,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Choose a number for y. How close to one lakh is the number of days in y years, for the y of your choice?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.145,
            0.292,
            0.168
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.172,
            0.848,
            0.21
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. According to the 2011 Census, the population of the town of Chintamani was about 75,000. How much less than one lakh is 75,000?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.214,
            0.846,
            0.252
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. The estimated population of Chintamani in the year 2024 is 1,06,000. How much more than one lakh is 1,06,000?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.256,
            0.846,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. By how much did the population of Chintamani increase from 2011 to 2024?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.313,
            0.551,
            0.334
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Getting a Feel of Large Numbers"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.345,
            0.69,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You may have come across interesting facts like these:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.449,
            0.971,
            0.55,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.369,
            0.694,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The world’s tallest statue is the ‘Statue of Unity’ in Gujarat depicting Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel. Its height is about 180 metres."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.429,
            0.714,
            0.468
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Kunchikal waterfall in Karnataka is said to drop from a height of about 450 metres."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.473,
            0.846,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "It is not always easy to get a sense of how big these measurements are. But, we can get a better sense of their size when we compare them with something familiar. Let us see an example."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.528,
            0.847,
            0.585
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Look at the picture on the right. Somu is 1 metre tall. If each floor is about four times his height, what is the approximate height of the building?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.592,
            0.846,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Which is taller — The Statue of Unity or this building? How much taller?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.643,
            0.43,
            0.718
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We can see that the height of the Statue of Unity is close to 4 times the height of Somu’s building."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.725,
            0.43,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How much taller is the Kunchikal waterfall than Somu's building? m."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.821,
            0.43,
            0.881
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How many floors should Somu’s building have to be as high as the waterfall?"
            }
          ]
        },
